<title>SWITZERLAND: FIGURE SKATING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP DANCE MEDALS.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP DANCE MEDALS.</headline>
<dateline>LAUSANNE, Switzerland 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russians Oksana Gritschuk and Evgeny Platov won the ice dance gold medals at the world figure skating championships on Friday.</p>
<p>Team mates Anjekila Krylova and Oleg Ovsiannikov took silver and Canadians Shae-Lynn Bourne and Victor Kraatz bronze.</p>
</text>
